0result.sql is the simplest, fully correct version:

• Correctly filters to status = 'delivered' and to the three requested years.  
• Counts each delivered order once via conditional aggregation.  
• Uses CAST(month AS INTEGER) so months are ordered 1‑12 numerically (not just lexicographically).  
• Needs no extra CTE / JOIN like 1result.sql, keeping it shorter.  
• Produces exactly the required columns and values (same as 2result.sql) with minimal logic.

